&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;The Senior Technology Advisory Analyst serves as the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;fundamental pillar of AI-native advisory teams&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering clients to navigate the critical junction of strategy and technical execution.&lt;/div&gt;
